{"id":69543,"date":"2025-07-16T12:20:56","date_gmt":"2025-07-16T11:20:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69543"},"modified":"2026-10-12T11:55:10","modified_gmt":"2026-10-12T10:55:10","slug":"ultra-trail-do-marao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ultra-trail-do-marao\/","title":{"rendered":"Ultra Trail do Mar\u00e3o 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ultra Trail do Mar\u00e3o 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ultra Trail do Mar\u00e3o 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de Abril de 2027<\/strong>, com partida agendada em <strong>Amarante, Porto<\/strong>. Este evento \u00e9 considerado um dos desafios mais \u00e9picos e duros do panorama nacional, atraindo atletas que procuram superar os seus limites em alta montanha.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo conta com dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>120 km, 60 km, 40 km, 25 km, 15 km e uma Caminhada de 6 km<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado explora a grandiosidade e a dureza da Serra do Mar\u00e3o (o sexto ponto mais alto de Portugal), com trilhos altamente t\u00e9cnicos, cal\u00e7adas romanas, ref\u00fagios de pastores e a m\u00edtica passagem na Capela da Senhora da Serra, a mais de 1400 metros de altitude.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Mar\u00e3o Trail (ADMT)<\/strong>, uma entidade dedicada que tem projetado Amarante e a Serra do Mar\u00e3o como destinos de excel\u00eancia para o Trail Running nacional e internacional.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: c